        'rawContent': "{{Weapon Information|\n|name = Terran Gauss Cannon\n|type = Kinetic / Projectile Weapon\n|origin = [[Terra|Earth]] / [[United Earth Alliance]]\n|operator = [[United Earth Alliance]]\n}}\n\nThe '''Gauss Cannon''' is a medium energy form of the Mass Driver, capable of launching projectiles at high velocities.\n\nGauss Rifles While Autocannons are extremely powerful weapons, there is a limit to what can be accomplished with chemical explosions for propulsion. The Gauss Rifle is a new look on projectile weaponry. Instead of using explosive ammunition, it uses a powerful particle accelerator to hurl shells of nickel-ferrous alloy at its target. Gauss Rifles are very common among Terran units, as the quartermasters prefer the ease-of-maintenance of the non-explosive ammo.\n\n==GC-1==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-2==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-3==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-4==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-5==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-6==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-7==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-8==\n\nThe GC-1 is the prototype of the Gauss Cannon, used by the [[Royal Imperial Navy]] from [[2300]] to [[2316]].\n\n==GC-9==\n\nThe GC-9 is the latest model of \"Hellgun\" Gauss Cannon designed and built by [[Rahn Industries]]. The design was deployed to warships in the [[Prefecture Galactic Navy]] in [[2322]].\n\n[[Category:Projectile_Weapons]]\n[[Category:Projectile Weapons]]\n[[Category:Engineering Systems]]"
